    19→ * - expression/operators.h: All operator functors (AddOp, MulOp, etc.)
    20→ * - expression/expression_types.h: Core expression classes (BinaryOpExpr, UnaryOpExpr, etc.)
    21→ * - expression/expression_builders.h: Helper functions and operator overloads
    22→ *
    23→ * This file contains expression specializations and the core reactive computation logic.
    24→ */
